@startuml serial_mcu_exec 执行时序
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName "Segoe UI"
skinparam ArrowColor #5A5A5A
skinparam ArrowFontColor #333333
skinparam ArrowFontSize 12
skinparam SequenceParticipantBorderColor #7A93BE
skinparam SequenceParticipantBackgroundColor #DCE9FB
skinparam SequenceParticipantFontColor #1F2933
skinparam SequenceLifeLineBorderColor #7A93BE
skinparam SequenceGroupBackgroundColor #F7F9FC
skinparam SequenceGroupBorderColor #7A93BE
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #FFFBE6
skinparam NoteBorderColor #E0B400
skinparam NoteFontColor #5C4A00

title serial_mcu_exec 一次调用的执行时序（实测 wifi info: 609ms 返回）

participant "AI\n调用方" as AI
participant "MCP\nserial_mcu_exec" as M
participant "执行器\nrunMcuExec" as E
participant "输出缓冲\nOutputBuffer" as B
participant "固件\n(STM32 app)" as F

== 守卫与前置 ==

AI -> M : serial_mcu_exec(session_id, command, timeoutMs)
M -> M : 守卫: getMcuConfig(会话设备名)\n未启用 serial.mcu 则拒绝
M -> E : runMcuExec(...)

E -> B : drain() 前置冲刷
note right : 丢弃发送前的残留心跳\n保证 output 不含旧数据

E -> F : write(command + "\\r\\n") 裸发送
note over E, F : 无 marker 包装 · 不剥回显\n行尾由 serial.lineEnding 决定

== 轮询循环（每 200ms 一轮, 先到者判定）==

loop 直到三出口之一
  E -> B : drain()
  B --> E : 新到输出
  F --> B : 应答行 / 心跳行\n(flash-app count = N)
  E -> E : pattern 命中?\n距最后字节静默 ≥ quietMs(400ms)?\n耗满 timeoutMs?
end

E --> M : { output, flushed,\ncompletedBy = quiet, elapsedMs = 609 }
M --> AI : 应答输出（含心跳行）\n+ [MCU: 静默 400ms 判定完成, 耗时 609ms]

note over E, F
  实测: timeoutMs 传 3000, 实际 609ms 返回
  timeoutMs 是兜底保险丝, 不是固定等待
  出口优先级: pattern > quiet > timeout
end note

@enduml
